OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy, humid and damp through
OL,6,Fthe morning with outbreaks of rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle, and the odd heavier burst
OL,8,Fmixed in. Gradually turning drier and
OL,9,Fbrighter from the northwest through
OL,10,Fthe afternoon. Winds mainly light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAreas of cloud and some
OL,13,Fclearer periods, these allowing the
OL,14,Fodd mist and fog patch to form. Winds
OL,15,Fremaining mainly light. Mild.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FAreas of cloud giving a few
OL,18,Fshowers in places through the morning
OL,19,Fbut generally drier and brighter into
OL,20,Fthe afternoon. Feeling warm or very
OL,21,Fwarm with a gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
